# Marketing roles

| Product name | DB role id | Branch assignment |
|---|---|---|
| **Marketing** | `MARKETING` | HQ sentinel → **All Branches (organization)** — marketing leader |
| **Branch Marketing** | `BRANCH_MARKETING` | Assigned clinic (e.g. San Mateo) — same tools, one branch only |

## Access

- Sidebar category **Marketing & Sales** (exact order): **KPI Overview**, **Messages**, **Ads**, **Sales & Goals**, **Offers**
- Routes: `/admin/marketing/dashboard`, `/admin/marketing/messages`, `/admin/marketing/ads`, `/admin/marketing/sales`, `/admin/marketing/offers`
- Funnel: ADS → **Message** → **Book** → **Show up** → **Buy** (KPIs: CPM, BR, SR, CR, AOV, ₱2M/branch)
- Lead sources: Facebook Ads, Facebook Groups, Instagram, TikTok (+ website, walk-in, referral)
- **Ads:** Named Facebook-style campaigns on `/admin/marketing/ads` — manual spend + impressions/reach/clicks/messages/clients; ranked by clients so owners see best creatives.
- **Handoff:** Marketing taps **Send to clinic** → clinic sees **Marketing Handoffs** (read-only status board). Funnel advances from clinic book / cancel / show-up / checkout. Branch Marketing can only send to **their** clinic.
- Create account:
  - Role **Marketing** → branch locks to **All Branches (organization)**
  - Role **Branch Marketing** → pick a clinic (required); UI/data locked like staff
- Not full HQ (no warehouse, user-access admin, branch CRUD unless HQ)

## Implementation notes

- Frontend: `isMarketingRole` (org), `isBranchMarketingRole`, `isAnyMarketingRole`, `canAccessMarketing`, `RequireMarketing`, `buildMarketingNavItems`, `isBranchScopedStaff` includes Branch Marketing
- Sync: `syncHandoffOnPatientBooked` / `syncHandoffOnShowUp` / `syncHandoffOnBookingCancelled` / `syncHandoffOnSale`
- Data: `marketing_leads`, `marketing_ad_spend`; migrations `20261005000066`–`71`
- RLS: Branch Marketing reads/writes leads/spend for `user_branch_ids()` only; org Marketing + HQ see all
